    - rid: 1000
      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: a5742a32ad0c4debadafb4de86229827
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'Siege a target that went to ground: while it hides in a bush or behind cover it was seen going into, keep the pressure on — grenades on the spot to flush it out (not the squad''s suppressor, who keeps firing), fire into the spot, flankers bound to a fresh angle on it — until it breaks cover or the trail goes cold. Interrupts searching and watching below it.'
        _children:
        - 7de88e0deed84d718206c6a2c87a880f
    - rid: 1001
      type: {class: Sequence, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: 7de88e0deed84d718206c6a2c87a880f
        _position: {x: 0, y: 150}
        _comment: 'Flush it out while it hides; stops the moment it shows itself'
        _children:
